WEBVTT

00:21.870 --> 00:22.750
Tomoka.

00:25.450 --> 00:27.710
It's our victory, Minato.

00:28.870 --> 00:30.630
There's...

00:32.110 --> 00:33.630
There's no way I'll lose!

00:57.110 --> 01:00.450
Don't give up and do your best

01:00.450 --> 01:03.830
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

01:03.830 --> 01:06.870
I know perfectly

01:06.870 --> 01:10.540
How weak a person is on their own

01:10.750 --> 01:13.710
Things that are on the verge of being lost

01:13.710 --> 01:17.390
I hold them close to my chest

01:17.390 --> 01:20.350
Your gentle words

01:20.350 --> 01:24.310
Caress my cheeks

01:24.310 --> 01:27.350
The irritation that has been building up

01:27.350 --> 01:30.150
From wanting to reach the goal

01:30.150 --> 01:34.320
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:34.320 --> 01:37.910
The place that warms it up

01:37.910 --> 01:40.830
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:40.830 --> 01:44.330
We have to protect this

01:44.330 --> 01:45.790
We're unripe fighters!

01:45.790 --> 01:47.710
We won't lose now

01:47.710 --> 01:51.090
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:51.090 --> 01:54.510
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:54.510 --> 01:57.970
Then release it towards the sky!

01:57.970 --> 01:59.510
The courage that cannot be stopped

01:59.510 --> 02:01.350
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

02:01.350 --> 02:04.270
I will pass the ball to you

02:04.270 --> 02:08.560
The memories that are awoken by our calls

02:08.560 --> 02:12.110
Will move the game along

02:19.070 --> 02:23.950
The Elementary Schoolers are Coming<i>!</i> Yay<i>!</i> Yay<i>!</i> Yay<i>!</i>

02:28.580 --> 02:33.340
Sign: Keishin Private Academy

02:34.380 --> 02:37.010
Hey, hey, what kind of person do you think is coming?

02:37.800 --> 02:40.090
It would be nice if he isn't a scary person.

02:40.550 --> 02:41.840
It'll be fine!

02:41.840 --> 02:45.680
If he's Mihoshi-sensei's nephew,
then I don't think he'll be a bad person.

02:45.680 --> 02:48.600
They said he's a high school student, right?

02:48.600 --> 02:50.810
He's Mii-tan's nephew, after all,

02:50.810 --> 02:54.070
so I'm sure he'll be all over us!

02:54.070 --> 02:57.690
Let's make sure this plan succeeds!

02:57.690 --> 02:59.860
Ah, this is perfect!

03:00.270 --> 03:04.370
Let's work hard together, and make him love us.

03:09.500 --> 03:12.170
Welcome back, Master!

03:14.130 --> 03:17.800
Um... Are you all from the girls' basketball club?

03:19.540 --> 03:23.930
I'm Minato Tomoka, sixth grade in the
elementary division of Keishin Academy.

03:23.930 --> 03:26.600
Same here! I'm Misawa Maho!

03:27.470 --> 03:28.770
I'm Nagatsuka Saki.

03:30.730 --> 03:34.060
I'm Ka... Kashii Airi.

03:34.640 --> 03:35.860
Hinata.

03:35.860 --> 03:37.730
Hakamada Hinata.

03:37.730 --> 03:39.090
Ready, and...

03:39.090 --> 03:41.570
Please take good care of us, Master!

03:43.280 --> 03:46.370
Could you all stop with the "Master" thing?

03:52.250 --> 03:54.630
Understood, Onii-chan!

03:54.630 --> 03:58.550
Ah, Onii-chan, what's your name?

03:59.510 --> 04:02.830
Um, I'm Hasegawa Subaru.

04:02.830 --> 04:04.530
I'm in my first year of high school.

04:04.530 --> 04:06.930
How much experience do you have playing basketball?

04:06.930 --> 04:08.760
I've played for about six years.

04:08.760 --> 04:12.140
Onii-chan, stop being so formal!

04:12.450 --> 04:13.520
Misawa-san?!

04:13.520 --> 04:16.020
Can't you call Maho by her name?

04:16.020 --> 04:18.770
And you're not allowed to isolate yourself from us.

04:18.770 --> 04:20.440
Is that okay, Onii-chan?

04:20.440 --> 04:24.860
In exchange, could you stop calling me Onii-chan?

04:26.160 --> 04:28.200
That's not allowed either?

04:28.200 --> 04:30.660
You don't get turned on by little sister maids?

04:30.660 --> 04:31.830
Little sister maids?

04:32.150 --> 04:34.580
Then, what is Subaru interested in?

04:34.580 --> 04:35.960
Little sister androids?

04:35.960 --> 04:36.830
Animals?

04:36.830 --> 04:37.710
Or would you rather-

04:37.710 --> 04:40.010
You should back down a little.

04:40.970 --> 04:42.090
I'm sorry.

04:42.090 --> 04:45.350
Maho's getting a little over-excited.

04:45.350 --> 04:46.640
Ah, it's fine...

04:47.660 --> 04:50.660
I'm sorry for asking you this straight away,

04:50.660 --> 04:53.060
but could you coach us?

04:53.400 --> 04:56.090
I'm sorry for being a little forceful.

04:56.090 --> 04:57.230
That's right.

04:57.230 --> 04:59.480
Then, could everyone get changed?

05:00.600 --> 05:01.860
Why?!

05:01.860 --> 05:03.900
If it's panties, you don't have to worry.

05:03.900 --> 05:04.650
See?

05:06.490 --> 05:08.620
Everyone's wearing them!

05:10.740 --> 05:11.620
There!

05:13.320 --> 05:15.410
Idiot Maho, aren't you just begging for attention?

05:15.820 --> 05:17.840
It's fine, we're all girls.

05:17.840 --> 05:18.880
Oh.

05:18.880 --> 05:21.710
Hinata is in them too.

05:19.500 --> 05:21.710
Hinata, don't do that!

05:21.710 --> 05:25.510
Anyway, could you all get changed?

05:25.510 --> 05:27.010
That's right.

05:27.010 --> 05:28.930
Come on, let's go, Maho!

05:29.510 --> 05:31.850
Then, we'll meet again later, Subaru.

05:31.850 --> 05:33.520
Come on, walk properly.

05:33.520 --> 05:34.480
I <i>am</i> walking!

05:34.480 --> 05:35.970
Stop whining!

05:41.070 --> 05:45.070
And here I thought I wasn't going to get involved with basketball ever again...

05:45.070 --> 05:47.510
Yo, member of the lolicon club.

05:50.260 --> 05:51.330
Miho-nee.

05:52.690 --> 05:54.540
I heard all about it, Subaru!

05:54.540 --> 05:59.040
Your club president had his eyes on your advisor's daughter, and your club was suspended for a year!

05:59.040 --> 06:01.300
On top of that, the girl was an elementary school kid!

06:01.300 --> 06:04.050
Basketball club sure sounds troublesome, doesn't it?

06:04.670 --> 06:06.880
Geez, must have been Mum.

06:08.090 --> 06:09.470
You can't hide it from me!

06:09.470 --> 06:13.050
Unfortunately, Onee-chan is really bad at hiding things.

06:14.770 --> 06:18.520
But the first year of high school sure is long.

06:20.990 --> 06:23.150
You sure are unlucky.

06:23.150 --> 06:26.650
Even though you finally got into a high
school through a sports recommendation...

06:26.650 --> 06:29.150
So, what did you come here for?

06:29.150 --> 06:31.530
Firstly, is it okay to skip school, <i>Sensei</i>?

06:31.950 --> 06:33.910
I have a favour to ask you.

06:34.450 --> 06:35.240
Me?

06:35.240 --> 06:36.830
Yeah, that's right.

06:36.830 --> 06:40.650
The person who, at five years of age,

06:40.650 --> 06:43.880
dirtied my first bra and turned it black, rendering it useless.

06:43.880 --> 06:44.750
Huh?!

06:44.750 --> 06:47.250
I see, I see.

06:47.250 --> 06:52.430
So my nephew is embarrassed that the world
might learn about his unique sexual proclivities.

06:52.430 --> 06:55.600
Could a five-year-old have sexual proclivities?!

06:58.890 --> 07:02.850
Geez, it's not funny when you bring that up.

07:03.610 --> 07:04.440
So?

07:05.110 --> 07:08.690
I want Subaru to be the coach of the girls' basketball club.

07:09.990 --> 07:13.910
You see, I became their advisor not too long ago for various reasons,

07:13.910 --> 07:16.950
but I know nothing about the rules.

07:16.950 --> 07:21.210
When you were in middle school, you led that weak-looking club of yours to the semi-finals of the prefecture competition,

07:21.210 --> 07:22.920
and that made you well-known, right?

07:22.920 --> 07:24.540
So, with your brains-

07:24.540 --> 07:25.750
No thanks.

07:30.590 --> 07:32.760
Geez, that isn't even a joke.

07:37.140 --> 07:38.100
When did you get into my room?!

07:43.270 --> 07:45.110
You're not human.

07:46.690 --> 07:49.280
So, shall we hear your answer?

07:49.820 --> 07:52.740
I already said "No thanks", didn't I?

07:52.740 --> 07:57.450
You already know the reason why our club was suspended, right?

07:57.870 --> 07:59.500
Don't tell me you're interested in those girls, too?

07:59.500 --> 08:00.660
Like hell I am!

08:00.660 --> 08:02.360
Isn't it okay, then?

08:03.440 --> 08:05.420
Please. It's just for three days.

08:05.830 --> 08:07.880
Teach those girls how to play basketball.

08:08.640 --> 08:10.630
Even if you tell me that...

08:10.630 --> 08:11.800
I see.

08:12.680 --> 08:14.180
What's this?

08:15.930 --> 08:17.760
"I Love my Mother."

08:17.760 --> 08:19.220
By Hasegawa Subaru.

08:19.220 --> 08:21.890
I love my mother very much.

08:21.890 --> 08:24.060
That's because she always makes such delicious food-

08:24.060 --> 08:25.350
What are you reading?! Give it back!

08:28.440 --> 08:32.780
Shall I release your essay on the Internet for the world to see?

08:33.240 --> 08:34.500
That's cheating!

08:34.500 --> 08:37.200
So, what will you do?

08:40.360 --> 08:43.230
Three days only!

08:46.130 --> 08:50.000
I feel like I've been manipulated well by Miho-nee.

08:51.630 --> 08:54.300
Seems like the little sister maids were a failure.

08:54.300 --> 08:55.340
Okay!

08:55.340 --> 08:57.300
We've got to think of the next plan.

08:57.300 --> 09:01.220
Anything you think of won't be good, so no.

09:01.500 --> 09:05.770
Anyway, we've got to make Hasegawa-san think we have some potential.

09:06.650 --> 09:08.730
I'm sorry, everyone.

09:08.730 --> 09:11.320
This was originally my fault.

09:11.320 --> 09:13.440
That's not true, Mo-kan!

09:13.440 --> 09:15.650
This is already war.

09:15.650 --> 09:16.950
That's right.

09:16.950 --> 09:19.070
It's already everyone's problem,

09:19.070 --> 09:21.510
so you don't have to blame yourself.

09:22.490 --> 09:26.190
I'll work hard so I don't hold everybody back.

09:27.610 --> 09:28.750
Let's do it!

09:29.250 --> 09:31.880
Thank you, everyone.

09:33.010 --> 09:35.380
Sorry to have kept you waiting!

09:38.010 --> 09:39.800
Please take good care of us!

09:40.760 --> 09:43.970
Then, let's do some coordination practice today.

09:44.430 --> 09:47.640
Two of you on offence, and three on defence.

09:47.640 --> 09:49.940
We'll switch roles from time to time.

09:49.940 --> 09:50.770
Is that okay?

09:50.770 --> 09:51.730
Understood.

09:52.190 --> 09:54.440
Hey, what's offence?

09:54.820 --> 09:56.320
It refers to the attacking side.

09:56.320 --> 09:57.740
Defence is the side that protects the basket.

09:57.740 --> 09:58.490
Oh!

09:58.490 --> 10:00.240
Way to go, Mo-kan!

10:00.240 --> 10:03.290
Is Tomoka the only one that has played basketball?

10:03.290 --> 10:04.040
Yes.

10:04.350 --> 10:05.300
Okay.

10:05.300 --> 10:08.460
If there's anything you don't understand, I'll teach you along the way.

10:08.800 --> 10:10.880
First, we'll have Tomoka and Maho on offence.

10:11.300 --> 10:12.960
The remaining three will be on defence.

10:12.960 --> 10:13.710
Okay?

10:13.710 --> 10:15.090
Yes!

10:16.800 --> 10:18.130
Ah, Airi!

10:18.130 --> 10:19.340
Yes!

10:20.180 --> 10:21.970
It's about the defence.

10:21.970 --> 10:23.470
You're quite tall.

10:24.310 --> 10:28.230
So, you should just stand right in front of the basket-

10:32.980 --> 10:36.150
As I thought, I'm too big!

10:36.150 --> 10:38.610
I'm a huge girl...

10:40.410 --> 10:41.660
Airin!

10:41.660 --> 10:44.200
You didn't tell Subaru your birthday, so...

10:44.200 --> 10:45.540
That's right!

10:45.540 --> 10:48.000
Airi is the perfect size!

10:48.000 --> 10:50.870
Airi, I have tissues here.

10:51.200 --> 10:53.710
She has a complex about her height.

10:53.710 --> 10:56.800
Whenever someone says something about her height, it always turns out like this.

10:56.800 --> 10:58.550
So that's why...

10:58.550 --> 11:00.180
Excuse me.

11:00.180 --> 11:04.300
Could you tell Airi that you didn't know she was born in April?

11:00.180 --> 11:04.300
TL Note: In Japan, people born in the first half of the year are thought to be precocious, i.e., prematurely developed.

11:04.300 --> 11:06.600
Is it okay to tell her that?

11:06.960 --> 11:08.270
It's fine.

11:08.270 --> 11:10.770
We've been doing that for a long time.

11:16.730 --> 11:19.860
I'm sorry for getting all worked up like that.

11:19.860 --> 11:23.200
No, I was being tactless.

11:23.200 --> 11:24.160
Sorry about that.

11:24.700 --> 11:26.410
Let's practise again tomorrow.

11:26.410 --> 11:27.330
Yes!

11:27.330 --> 11:29.580
Let's go, Airin.

12:05.240 --> 12:06.460
Tomoka!

12:10.750 --> 12:14.880
Sorry, but could you show me that again?

12:23.930 --> 12:25.510
I'm sorry, everyone.

12:25.510 --> 12:28.470
I made us lose precious practice time.

12:28.470 --> 12:31.430
No, don't worry about it.

12:31.430 --> 12:33.730
Of course we're rushing,

12:33.730 --> 12:36.650
but it's meaningless if we can't have fun playing basketball together.

12:37.400 --> 12:40.530
Let's ask Hasegawa-san for another chance.

12:41.070 --> 12:41.990
Okay!

12:41.990 --> 12:43.950
Let's raise our affection level with Subaru tomorrow!

12:45.100 --> 12:46.320
Am I...

12:46.320 --> 12:48.450
Am I really that tall?

12:49.830 --> 12:52.200
Not at all.

12:52.200 --> 12:53.500
That's right.

12:53.500 --> 12:56.960
That developed chest is proof that you are precocious.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.750
If you complain some more, I'll fondle them for you.

12:59.710 --> 13:00.750
Oh!

13:00.750 --> 13:02.670
Hina will fondle them too!

13:02.670 --> 13:03.840
When did you-

13:04.630 --> 13:06.300
I'll do that too!

13:06.300 --> 13:09.140
I'm going to inspect you!

13:09.140 --> 13:12.390
Stop it!

13:12.810 --> 13:15.020
So, how were the girls?

13:15.020 --> 13:17.350
"How were they?" you ask...

13:17.350 --> 13:20.120
They didn't seem to be anywhere up to standard.

13:20.970 --> 13:21.760
I see.

13:21.760 --> 13:23.340
That's a pity.

13:23.340 --> 13:24.320
But...

13:26.820 --> 13:29.200
There's one girl I'm interested in.

13:30.620 --> 13:32.870
So, will you continue coaching them?

13:32.870 --> 13:34.620
The deal was three days.

13:34.620 --> 13:35.870
Fine, fine.

13:47.220 --> 13:51.440
It has been decided that Nashiba High School's basketball club...

13:51.440 --> 13:54.050
...will cease all activities and be suspended for one year.

14:06.050 --> 14:08.110
It's my selfish request,

14:08.860 --> 14:12.120
but I don't want to lose that place.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.050
Why did that happen?!

14:24.050 --> 14:27.170
What's the 30-second rule?!

14:35.840 --> 14:39.310
Aries is a hairpin, Virgo is a tumbler,

14:39.310 --> 14:41.980
Cancer is jam, and Pisces is a strap.

14:56.700 --> 14:58.030
It's delicious!

14:58.030 --> 14:59.870
The chicken is so crispy!

14:59.870 --> 15:02.500
Hina, is there something that you don't like again?

15:02.500 --> 15:03.540
Yup.

15:03.540 --> 15:04.630
The capsicum.

15:04.630 --> 15:05.420
Give it to me.

15:05.420 --> 15:06.630
I'll eat it for you.

15:06.630 --> 15:07.800
Thanks.

15:07.800 --> 15:09.970
Ah, that's right.

15:10.380 --> 15:13.350
I have something to give to everyone.

15:17.400 --> 15:18.810
What are these?

15:18.810 --> 15:20.980
They're this week's lucky items.

15:20.980 --> 15:23.860
I was thinking that good things
would happen to us if we had these.

15:24.770 --> 15:26.820
Thank you, Airin!

15:26.820 --> 15:28.030
It's jam.

15:28.030 --> 15:30.700
Ah, mine is marmalade!

15:32.740 --> 15:34.830
It's a fish strap!

15:35.140 --> 15:38.250
If we carry these and train hard, we'll definitely...

15:38.250 --> 15:40.900
...raise our affection levels with Subaru.

15:41.810 --> 15:43.790
He'll be just like our Onii-chan!

15:43.790 --> 15:44.960
Yup!

15:45.340 --> 15:49.090
When you shoot, bend your arms forward at a 45-degree angle,

15:49.090 --> 15:51.170
not straight up or directly in front of you.

15:51.490 --> 15:54.890
And bend your knees gently, just like a bunny.

15:54.890 --> 15:55.950
Yes!

15:57.180 --> 15:58.520
Forward...

15:58.520 --> 16:00.350
Bend my knees gently...

16:05.560 --> 16:06.980
It went in!

16:07.940 --> 16:11.490
When you pass, try not to keep
your elbows too close to your body.

16:11.490 --> 16:14.660
Your arms and hands will form something like a triangle.

16:15.050 --> 16:17.240
Triangle, triangle.

16:18.120 --> 16:19.290
It's true!

16:19.290 --> 16:20.950
It goes really fast!

16:20.950 --> 16:22.540
That's our Subaru!

16:23.000 --> 16:24.750
All right...

16:44.850 --> 16:46.020
I see.

16:46.980 --> 16:49.860
Be it yesterday's shooting, or today's passing,

16:50.610 --> 16:53.280
it looks like Tomoka's very experienced in basketball.

16:53.950 --> 16:56.200
Mo-kan, pass!

16:57.280 --> 17:01.660
Although Maho makes a few moves that are unnecessary, she's fast and jumps high.

17:01.940 --> 17:03.500
Her stamina is good too.

17:04.080 --> 17:05.950
Saki's movement isn't too bad, either.

17:05.950 --> 17:09.420
Her situational adaptation and movement prediction are good.

17:10.210 --> 17:11.460
Airi!

17:13.340 --> 17:15.880
You shouldn't dodge it, Airi.

17:15.880 --> 17:18.010
Sorry...

17:21.760 --> 17:25.100
Those two will probably take a while.

17:25.670 --> 17:26.960
It's hot, it's hot.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.520
I'm sorry for what I did just now.

17:28.520 --> 17:30.230
I'll work hard next time.

17:30.820 --> 17:32.110
I see.

17:32.110 --> 17:34.610
So you've been practising using this checklist?

17:34.610 --> 17:36.200
Yes.

17:36.200 --> 17:37.490
Looks nice.

17:37.820 --> 17:41.310
But I think a one-two layup would be a little too difficult for you.

17:41.310 --> 17:42.120
Yes.

17:42.490 --> 17:45.250
But just doing the basics would be a little too boring.

17:45.520 --> 17:47.850
Seems like I've got to come up with something for that.

17:52.100 --> 17:53.590
It's the practice list!

17:54.260 --> 17:55.340
Hey, Subaru!

17:55.340 --> 17:58.130
Use your skills and make us strong!

17:58.130 --> 18:01.260
Somewhere along the lines of
levelling up three levels in one hour!

18:02.710 --> 18:07.640
If we gain three levels in one hour, then after
two one-hour training sessions for three days...

18:07.640 --> 18:09.440
Eighteen levels?

18:09.900 --> 18:13.400
Hey, Subaru, what standard is level 18?

18:13.740 --> 18:16.610
It'd be a breeze to win the prefectural competition, right?

18:18.650 --> 18:20.320
That would be quite hard.

18:21.490 --> 18:24.410
Even if you can't do it in three days, if you work hard and continue practising-

18:24.410 --> 18:25.750
We'll be troubled!

18:25.750 --> 18:27.120
If it can't be done, we'll be troubled!

18:27.460 --> 18:28.560
What's up with that?

18:28.560 --> 18:31.420
People normally gain ten levels in one game!

18:31.960 --> 18:33.420
That's impossible.

18:33.420 --> 18:34.880
You would need at least a month-

18:34.880 --> 18:36.800
We can't wait a whole month!

18:36.800 --> 18:39.180
Hey, Subaru, please!

18:39.630 --> 18:41.590
You can ask all you want...

18:44.640 --> 18:46.470
I don't care any more!

18:55.440 --> 18:59.280
Getting good in three days really is impossible.

19:03.870 --> 19:08.290
"Quit being the girls' basketball club's coach immediately"?

19:15.420 --> 19:17.340
Tomoka

19:16.380 --> 19:17.340
Maho?

19:23.260 --> 19:24.300
I'm here.

19:24.300 --> 19:25.140
Thank goodness.

19:30.690 --> 19:34.190
Since you went home early, I was wondering if you were all right.

19:34.190 --> 19:35.230
That's right!

19:35.230 --> 19:36.900
Everyone was worried about you.

19:36.900 --> 19:39.400
Well, I was disappointed with Subaru!

19:39.400 --> 19:42.450
Although it's a pity, it's just like what Hasegawa-san said.

19:42.820 --> 19:46.120
Now that it's down to this, maybe we should tell him the truth.

19:46.120 --> 19:49.540
But it's really hard to get the timing right.

19:50.500 --> 19:51.960
Onii-chan...

19:51.960 --> 19:55.290
We really wanted to try to give him a good impression of us.

19:55.290 --> 19:56.170
Airin!

19:56.170 --> 19:58.210
Let Subaru fondle your breasts!

19:58.210 --> 20:00.090
