21:34.980 --> 21:36.530
I wonder what happened?

21:37.310 --> 21:40.820
Did he get angry over what I did yesterday?

21:40.820 --> 21:44.110
But he doesn't seem like the kind of person who'd quit halfway through something.

21:44.110 --> 21:45.280
That's right!

21:45.280 --> 21:47.570
Subaru will definitely come!

21:47.570 --> 21:50.030
Your attitude changes too quickly.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.650
